OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FLabour has retained the Mayor of
OL,7,FGreater Manchester title after fending
OL,8,Foff a challenge from Reform UK in a
OL,9,Fresult which came 15 hours after
OL,10,Fcounting began.
OL,12,FBev Craig was declared the new metro
OL,13,Fmayor, winning 309,525 votes, beating
OL,14,Fsecond place Sian Astley of Reform UK,
OL,15,Fwho had 157, 178 ballots cast in her
OL,16,Ffavour, after both first and second
OL,17,Fvotes were counted.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/14
