OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FThe new Mayor of Greater Manchester
OL,7,Fbegan her victory speech by thanking
OL,8,Fher fellow candidates along with the
OL,9,Fpeople of the City Region for
OL,10,Fsupporting her.
OL,12,FShe went on to say: "I'm honoured, I'm
OL,13,Fhumbled, and I stand ready to serve
OL,14,Fthe three million people that live
OL,15,Facross this fantastic city region. I
OL,16,Fwill serve every single one of them
OL,17,Fevery single day.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
