PN,36503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785595673
OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,F"I didn't believed as a girl growing
OL,7,Fup on a council estate that one day I
OL,8,Fwould have a chance to stand for a
OL,9,Fplace that I love, for a place I call
OL,10,Fhome... because Greater Manchester is
OL,11,Fspecial."
OL,13,FMs Craig spoke of the cost of living
OL,14,Fcrisis promising "every single
OL,15,Fdecision I take as your mayor of
OL,16,Fgreater Manchester will make your
OL,17,Flives better".
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
