OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FShe also reaffirmed her pledge to
OL,7,Fintroduce free bus travel for all 11-
OL,8,F18 year olds across Greater
OL,9,FManchester, "to give the message they
OL,10,Fcould be anything they wanted to be
OL,11,Fand go anywhere they wanted to go."
OL,13,FShe ended her speech by calling for
OL,14,Funity and vowing to be the Mayor for
OL,15,Feveryone in Greater Manchester, not
OL,16,Fjust her supporters.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/14
