OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785595673
OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FShe said: "To those who supported me,
OL,7,Fthank you... and to those who didn't
OL,8,Fvote for me I will still be your
OL,9,FMayor. I will defend this city region
OL,10,Fwith every bone in my body and fight
OL,11,Ffor a better life for you.
OL,13,F"I will work for everyone. I will be a
OL,14,Fbetter Mayor for everyone."
OL,16,FBev Craig paid tribute to the past of
OL,17,FGreater Manchester, but said she felt
OL,18,Fits true potential lay in its future,
OL,19,Ftalking abut things she wanted to do.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/14
