OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FMore than two million people were
OL,7,Feligible to vote in the by-election,
OL,8,Fmaking it the biggest in UK history,
OL,9,Fbut just 25% turned out to cast their
OL,10,Fballot - compared to 32% in the May
OL,11,F2024 election - making it the lowest
OL,12,Fturnout in the history of the Greater
OL,13,FManchester mayoralty.
OL,15,FIt was triggered when former Greater
OL,16,FManchester Mayor Andy Burnham resigned
OL,17,Ffrom the post as part of his plan to
OL,18,Fbecome prime minister.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
