OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FHe was elected as the Labour MP for
OL,7,FMakerfield in June, before taking over
OL,8,Ffrom Sir Keir Starmer just five weeks
OL,9,Flater.
OL,11,FResidents of Bolton, Bury, Manchester,
OL,12,FOldham, Rochdale, Salford, Stockport,
OL,13,FTameside, Trafford and Wigan cast
OL,14,Ftheir vote.
OL,16,FBurnham came first in all 10 areas in
OL,17,F2017, 2021 and 2024.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/14
