OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FReform UK and Labour went through to
OL,7,Fthe second round of voting in the
OL,8,Fcontest after neither Ms Craig or Ms
OL,9,FAstley managed to secure a majority
OL,10,Fafter the first round.
OL,12,FIt meant voters' second choice ballots
OL,13,Fwere counted to decide an overall
OL,14,Fwinner.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/14
