OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FFollowing the decision, five
OL,7,Fcandidates were eliminated from the be-
OL,8,Felection - the Green Party's Geraldine
OL,9,FCoggins, Phil Eckersley for the
OL,10,FConservatives, independent candidate
OL,11,FMarcus Farmer, Richard Kilpatrick for
OL,12,Fthe Liberal Democrats and Restore
OL,13,FBritain's Marlon West.
OL,15,FSpeaking after the final result Ms
OL,16,FAstley said she was "really happy",
OL,17,Fand will now go back to her role as a
OL,18,Flocal councillor for Baguley in
OL,19,FManchester - something she was excited
OL,20,Fto return to.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/14
