OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,F"I am feeling really, really happy
OL,7,Fwith the result that we delivered,
OL,8,FReform UK, and myself, and my team
OL,9,Facross Greater Manchester," she said.
OL,11,F"I think it's absolutely phenomenal
OL,12,Freally, an awesome result. We got in
OL,13,F2024 7.5% of the vote, just under
OL,14,F50,00 and it's over 157,000 - that's a
OL,15,Flot of votes, so pretty happy."
