OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FITV Granada Reports' Political
OL,7,FCorrespondent Lise McNally explains
OL,8,Fthe Supplementary Vote (SV) system
OL,10,FFor the by-election, voting changed
OL,11,Fback to the "supplementary vote" (SV)
OL,12,Fsystem used in the mayoral elections
OL,13,Fin 2017 and 2021.
OL,15,FIf any candidate wins more than 50% of
OL,16,Fthe first-choice votes, they are
OL,17,Fdeclared the winner.
OL,26,@sD@MOUsD@`O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G11/14
