CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F365A1785595673
OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FIf no candidate has more than 50% of
OL,7,Ffirst-choice votes, all but the top
OL,8,Ftwo candidates are eliminated and the
OL,9,Fcount moves to a second round.
OL,11,FThe ballot papers of the eliminated
OL,12,Fcandidates are counted again and if
OL,13,Fthere are any second-choice votes for
OL,14,Fthe two remaining candidates, these
OL,15,Fare added to their first-choice totals.
OL,17,FThe candidate with the highest overall
OL,18,Ftotal of first and second-choice votes
OL,19,Fis declared the winner.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G12/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
