OL,3,CLabour retain Greater Manchester Mayor
OL,4,Cas votes finally counted after 15 hours
OL,6,FIn 2021, the last time Manchester was
OL,7,Fcontested under the SV system, Burnham
OL,8,Fwon in the first round with 67% of
OL,9,Ffirst preference votes.
OL,11,FIt is the first time a by-election has
OL,12,Fbeen necessary to fill a vacancy for
OL,13,Fone of England's combined authority
OL,14,Fmayors.
OL,16,FThe cost of the contest is expected
OL,17,Frun into the millions, with the 2024
OL,18,Fmayoral election costing the taxpayer
OL,19,F#4.7 million.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}     G13/14
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
